{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Issue","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/UsingIvorGMN"]},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"What-is-judged-here","type":"heading","text":"What is judged here"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Everything a repair cannot reach. ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNParser","type":"reference"},{"text":" rejects what could never","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"be repaired and ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer","isActive":true},{"text":" repairs what it can, but neither","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"judges: normalization is total, so a defect it could not repair arrives","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"here intact.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two of the five are about a tag’s "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"body","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", and whether a tag scopes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"something is a fact about the score around it, which no repair could","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"guess at. The other three are about its ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"parameters","type":"text"}]},{"text":", and each is a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value that was written and then thrown away unread.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Why the parameter issues are judged after normalization","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Why-the-parameter-issues-are-judged-after-normalization"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A defect is only definite once every repair has been tried. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\volta"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"requires "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"mark"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\volta<m=\"1.\">"},{"type":"text","text":" supplies it under a name since"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"renamed — so the tag is missing a required parameter as written and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"complete after "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/normalize(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" renames it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The same holds for a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$variable"},{"type":"text","text":" that expands into a closed vocabulary,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and for a span end whose written parameters are dropped before they can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"overrun its template. This is why "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/validate(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Error\/notNormalized","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" rather than judging an unnormalized score."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Every issue is fatal","anchor":"Every-issue-is-fatal"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"There is no grading, and no issue is advisory. Any of the five leaves","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/validate(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" returning the score unvalidated, because","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a set this small holds nothing worth tolerating: a ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\slur","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" scoping","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"nothing, a ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\title","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" scoping something, and a ","type":"text"},{"code":"\\clef","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with no type are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"all defects the writer meant otherwise.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A Guido renderer warns on every one of the five and draws the score","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"anyway. That is a divergence, and a deliberate one — a renderer answers","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“can something be drawn?”, and this is a library answering “is this","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"score well formed?”. In each case a value that was written is thrown","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"away without being read, and the rendered score says nothing about the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"loss. What each field ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"means"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is Guido’s to say; what to do about a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"violation is not."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"IvorGMN"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","role":"symbol","extendedModule":"IvorGMN","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Issue"}],"title":"GMNValidator.Issue","externalID":"s:7IvorGMN12GMNValidatorV5IssueO","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Issue"}],"symbolKind":"enum"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorgmn\/gmnvalidator\/issue"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An issue found when validating a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNScore","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"schemaVersion":{"pa